# TypeScript incremental build state (`incremental: true` in tsconfig.json).
# `nest build` keeps this under dist/, but a direct `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json`
# writes it to the repo root, where it is otherwise untracked and easy to commit
# by accident.
*.tsbuildinfo
